{"product":{"id":8088646156542,"title":"RYSE Loaded Protein 2LB","body_html":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eRYSE Loaded Protein – 2lb\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eA premium daily \u003cstrong\u003ewhey protein\u003c\/strong\u003e built for serious lifters, physique athletes, and gym regulars who want clean macros, exceptional flavour, and added functional ingredients in a single formula. The 2lb tub is the ideal entry size — perfect for testing the formulation, taste, and tolerance before committing to a larger tub, or as a back-up for the office, gym bag, or travel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat separates RYSE Loaded Protein from the standard whey on the shelf comes down to two things: ingredient quality and the supporting cast around the protein itself. Each serving delivers 25g of protein from a dual-source blend of whey isolate (primary source) and whey concentrate (secondary), which contributes to both a premium taste and smoother texture than isolate-only products. On top of that, the formula adds 1g of MCT oil — a fast-absorbing fat that supports metabolism and energy while improving the shake's mouthfeel — plus prebiotic fibre to support gut health and digestion. The result is a shake that delivers real protein without the bloat that whey-concentrate products often cause, and one of the strongest flavour profiles in the category — RYSE's flavour reputation is well documented across consumer reviews. The label is also fully transparent with no proprietary blends.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eRYSE manufactures Loaded Protein in the United States in \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/health-topics\/good-manufacturing-practices\"\u003eGMP\u003c\/a\u003e certified, FDA-registered facilities, with patented and trademarked ingredients used throughout the formula. Note: Loaded Protein is not Informed-Sport certified — competing tested-pool athletes should choose a sport-certified alternative; for everyone else, RYSE's manufacturing pedigree, transparent labelling, and ingredient quality make it a credible choice in the \u003cstrong\u003ewhey protein Sri Lanka\u003c\/strong\u003e category.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e25g of whey protein per serving\u003c\/strong\u003e with whey isolate as the primary source — clean macros that genuinely outperform concentrate-heavy budget proteins\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdded prebiotic fibre\u003c\/strong\u003e for gut health and digestion — a category most cheap proteins skip entirely\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e1g of MCT oil included\u003c\/strong\u003e to support metabolism, energy, and shake texture\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy to digest, low bloat profile\u003c\/strong\u003e — meaningful for anyone whose previous whey caused stomach issues\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e2lb compact size\u003c\/strong\u003e — ideal trial format on the \u003cstrong\u003ewhey protein price in Sri Lanka\u003c\/strong\u003e category before committing to a larger tub, with a fully transparent label and no proprietary blends\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [\u0026amp;_\u0026gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePair it with a daily multivitamin or recovery supplement from our \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"\/collections\/vitamins-supplements\"\u003evitamins and supplements range\u003c\/a\u003e to round out a complete training stack.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"RYSE","product_type":"WHEY PROTEIN","created_at":"2023-07-15T15:09:23+05:30","handle":"ryse-loaded-protein-2lb","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:23:43+05:30","published_at":"2025-04-03T00:01:24+05:30","template_suffix":"ryse","published_scope":"global","tags":"WHEY PROTEIN BLEND","variants":[{"id":47152138453246,"product_id":8088646156542,"title":"27 Servings \/ Little Debbie® Cosmic Brownies","price":"24999.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"27 Servings","option2":"Little Debbie® Cosmic Brownies","opti